This crate (`symphonia-format-real`) is a from-scratch, pure-Rust RealMedia / RealAudio demuxer. It
is licensed under the Mozilla Public License, v. 2.0, like the rest of Project Symphonia.

RealMedia has no public specification. The header layouts (`.RMF` chunks, `.ra` v3/v4/v5 headers,
`MLTI` multi-rate descriptors), the packet resynchronisation, the index chunks, the codec FourCC
mapping, the audio de-interleavers (`genr`, `Int4`, `sipr`, `vbrs`/`vbrf`) and the SIPR nibble
reordering table follow FFmpeg's `libavformat/rmdec.c`, `libavformat/rm.c`, `libavformat/rm.h` and
`libavformat/rmsipr.c`, which are distributed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version
2.1 or later.

